This example's directory structure follows two publicly documented Flux
layouts:

  fluxcd/flux2-kustomize-helm-example
  https://github.com/fluxcd/flux2-kustomize-helm-example
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (the clusters/, infrastructure/, apps/ split)

  fluxcd/flux2-multi-tenancy
  https://github.com/fluxcd/flux2-multi-tenancy
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (the tenants/base/<team>/ split into rbac.yaml and sync.yaml, and applying
  a tenant's Kustomization with the tenant's own ServiceAccount)

No file content from either repository is copied here. Every file in this
directory was written for this example. The application content (the
apptique Deployment, Service, and Kustomize overlays) is reused from the
other examples in this repository, under this repository's own MIT license
(see the top-level LICENSE file).
